        "search :parameters (?character - character ?target - object ?object - object) :precondition (and (at ?character ?object) (not (found ?target))) :effect (when (not (foggy ?object)) (and (found ?target) (has ?character ?target))))": "(:action search :parameters (?character - character ?target - object ?object - object) :precondition (and (at ?character ?object) (not (found ?target))) :effect (when (not (foggy ?object)) (and (found ?target) (has ?character ?target))))"
